        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5052CCSKK, Conical Straight Knurled Knob with Modern Rectangular Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Straight Knurled Conical Knob with Rectangular Rose features a modern style ridged knob paired with a matching rectangle rosette. This modern knobset is available in all standard residential functions: dummy, passage, and privacy. Choose from your favorite contemporary finish color option. The Conical Ridged Knob and Rectangular Rose is easy to install and will fit most pre-drilled doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-CC-speecifications.gif?v=1704354555\" width=\"519\" height=\"297\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Conical Knob Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Emtek Select Rectangular Rose with Straight Knurled Conical Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Straight Knurled Conical Knobset with Rectangular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-cc-Specification.pdf?v=1704262419\"><b>Emtek Select Conical Knob Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This mix-match style knob is totally customizable. If you need a different finish combination or a different rose style, <a href=\"/pages/contact\"><b>Contact Us</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Straight Knurled Conical Knob with Rectangular Rose",
                "description": "The Straight Knurled Conical Knob with Rectangular Rose features a modern style ridged knob paired with a matching rectangle rosette. This modern knobset is available in all standard residential functions: dummy, passage, and privacy. Choose from your favorite contemporary finish color option. The Conical Ridged Knob and Rectangular Rose is easy to install and will fit most pre-drilled doors.",
